OL,5,G1655 Love Nature
OL,6,     FThe greater horseshoe bat was once
OL,7,     Fwidespread in the UK but due to
OL,8,     Fhabitat loss their numbers
OL,9,     Fplummeted. The Vincent Wildlife
OL,10,     FTrust look after around 50% of the
OL,11,     FUK's population.
OL,12,G1700 5 News with Dan Walker
OL,13,G1800 Amazing Railway Adventures with
OL,14,G     Nick Knowles
OL,15,     FThe presenter travels by rail from
OL,16,     Fthe extraordinary landscapes of
OL,17,     FPeru to Machu Picchu, visiting the
OL,18,     Ffourth highest train station in
OL,19,     Fthe world and Lake Titicaca en
OL,20,     Froute. (Ep6)
