OL,5,G1900 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FWith over 120,000 cars stolen in
OL,7,     Fthe UK every year, Traffic Cops
OL,8,     Fare cracking down on car crime. In
OL,9,     Fthis episode, officers are
OL,10,     Fstretched to the limit with three
OL,11,     Fpursuits in 30 minutes.
OL,12,G2000 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FCops pursue a lad on an e-bike
OL,14,     Fcarrying a machete, pull over a
OL,15,     Fvehicle bought online but with a
OL,16,     Fcloned number plate, and question
OL,17,     Fa driver about his packets of
OL,18,     Fwhite powder.
