OL,5,G2335 Murder: Suspect No.1
OL,6,     FIn Hull, three men are suspected
OL,7,     Fof murdering Jonathan Hutty after
OL,8,     Fhe is beaten to death at home. Can
OL,9,     Fdetectives overcome a major
OL,10,     Fsetback to the investigation and
OL,11,     Fnail the killer?
