OL,13,G0200 Amazing Railway Adventures with
OL,14,G     Nick Knowles
OL,15,     FTravelling north from Trondheim,
OL,16,     FNick stays for a night on the
OL,17,     FRiver Namsen, takes a helicopter
OL,18,     Fride, meets a reindeer herder and
OL,19,     Fgoes swimming in near freezing
OL,20,     Fsea. (Ep2)
